":"","text_original":"少々、苦しいですね……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/YK2Q3YRZoRjG6G1qJKVJYwXJIexJsqvx.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Battle_Shout_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"はぁ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/FfqfchPaQjnoPXsUgvezgbmzThjkgyC7.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Battle_Shout_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"やぁ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/Zncz0I19WOPoHlsWDH6VGPYptekLqKwT.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Battle_Shout_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"はぁ！やぁ！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/mB1rxZp0LejcLruITgw0Nn54kCmYbA9Y.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Battle_TacticalAction_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"次は、どちらでしょうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/HoQpfz8i81B5BrXyOywckGz55P3jTa0K.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Battle_Victory_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"無事に、救護が完了しました。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/EyjgpmzZ7yiAdm846Yq9OWf24HIPquZs.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Battle_Victory_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"私たちの勝利です。しかし、油断は禁物ですよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/4mZbwNPbms49Gkrpkf0Kmlwc2Wje2437.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Cafe_monolog_1.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"救護が必要な方は…いらっしゃいませんか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/NcA5Ky6FOnE07GJTrNjlJaxy7B4tNLrI.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Cafe_monolog_2.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"ここは…気持ちが安らぎますね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/F2MhXcGOwaeLhjXMXJ3hnubfnfGiTDeL.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Cafe_monolog_3.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"ここでお茶会を開くのはどうでしょう？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/Vimk3DfOdYFhyf1tMh4PScspe5txbc8k.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Cafe_monolog_4.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"誰にでも休息は必要です。もちろん、救護騎士団にも。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/nJM9i1BTrBGyxiNwQUVLJN8vm23JBP6a.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Cafe_monolog_5.ogg","category":"cafe","text":"","text_original":"健康と美容のために、食後に一杯の紅茶を。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/8v0gnwNXB0ql8PettMmz0jc6I8bjB8FQ.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_CommonSkill.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"全力で参ります！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/LwqDmY6ogYK9IQwne8eTPGTBYooc0SzH.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_ExSkill_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"参ります！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/jooE8gOyClXsy9zlSvaiqYnDjvW4LaU2.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_ExSkill_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"そちらですね！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/Xs9guVRll9c7UlZPeuBXCSJbGoAwfV9k.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_ExSkill_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"下がってください！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/rw84mL3MohajttFrVOsT8g6ByRP3JMKO.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_ExSkill_Level_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"戦場に、救護の手を！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/CH0152_ExSkill_Level_1.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_ExSkill_Level_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"誇りと信念を、胸に刻み！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/iwzzYuycvLfBJIKkdQ4739UFL5BEWKNU.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_ExSkill_Level_3.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"最後の、その瞬間まで！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/CGTuuNQHl2d0XSY4ryxm7zVXMkqfnjrC.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_ExWeapon_Get.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"お気遣いくださりありがとうございます。…私の全てを賭して、先生のお力となりましょう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/9yZXE7BjoL1MPQqDexGbGOCBur5CDJru.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Formation_In_1.ogg","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"かしこまりました。参りましょう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/zXPGaFSjflvOvfAvrJ68cX2X2XeKe0JG.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Formation_In_2.ogg","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"救護騎士団の出番ですね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/RxzbeakFM9Dq6WBWemhg7qgomwY4tFVG.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Formation_Select.ogg","category":"formation","text":"","text_original":"な、何が起きているのでしょうか…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/trP8GjHijQm3DdoQAEXIcDmgHHswOpNU.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Gachaget.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"救護騎士団団長、蒼森ミネと申します。 救護が必要な方はどちらでしょうか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/iBp2pmadPE7Nkw4zPp20XqsikeSL38Th.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Growup_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"私に……どうして、ここまで……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/J6Bs362iSk8igJ1zoMqy8rW19lI5tZHc.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Growup_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"ありがとうございます。先生。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/NerXh0WXgbyNJ1cBYrWhHAdA1GOYJzci.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Growup_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"うふっ、私が救護を受ける事になってしまいましたね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/IoKkF7oNAEx4msl0vq1aWD7gW7Hlx47t.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Growup_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"よろしければ、今度お茶でもいかがですか？何か、お礼がしたいのです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/LK4NUXIXehf6WxNfFgBVYemeymNTmVMc.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Lobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"どうかなさいましたか？私の手が必要でしたら、いつでもお呼びください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/rD0DmbQfttUDnX2y4bDDSZDev5MRhF9H.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Lobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"今日も忙しそうですね…何かお手伝いさせてください。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/QgIj1XPcPSh8b59ufjQ0WzIHhsLb7qlB.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Lobby_3.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"お疲れの時はいつでもおっしゃってください。 紅茶にお茶菓子、膝枕…私に出来ることでしたら、何なりと。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/D3ZqEk8SQLe5ycNbtqO1vPDGYQAOLMpr.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Lobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"救護騎士団の出番など、ないに越したことはありません。 そんな穏やかな日々が続きますように。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/n33QwJoJ46aw1MaZ9emILN9sNLttsht4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Lobby_5.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"救護騎士団の建物も悪くありませんが、こちらもなかなか素敵ですね。 いっそのこと、支部を移転するというのも… あ、いえ、独り言ですのでお構いなく。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/akQ249vAy3ZHF9LaamZhaLs4iQgDcx2E.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_LogIn_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ようこそお越しくださいました、先生。本日もキヴォトスの平和のため、共に励みましょう。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/lp1Wg4aGzUSJlp3YoWEG1xqpT5A42eZr.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_LogIn_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"先生、今日は何かあったのですか？ いえ、待つのは慣れていますので、お気になさらず。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/8raqra6gc5MRTAMBSxW3bVeeXsUTzmRA.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_MemorialLobby_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"先生、大丈夫ですか？お怪我などはありませんか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/C5mcH18LLGvy359piv4w3qO0Svspsp8l.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_MemorialLobby_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"夜の空気は気持ちが良いですね…。 草の香りに、川のせせらぎ…心が落ち着きます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/GYFLDsyjsuFjXX1rzvx42D10nIGdkwrv.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_MemorialLobby_3_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"…どうされましたか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/lcBXVNpyUoBtAvMT4dbRq0o15TsmWQhi.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_MemorialLobby_3_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"眩しい…ですか…？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/UeU7tx6DSxQhAAiKahrczP4fXPq5QEpP.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_MemorialLobby_4.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ふふ、確かにそうかもしれませんね。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/ELeoO3UZwnHUiWlXg7Y7tKL9y6mJoRPa.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_MemorialLobby_5_1.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"落ち着かないようでしたら、私にもたれたり膝でお休みいただいても構いませんよ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/tWV6XX84AFMojsxYO7ojFVwSDtbFpWpV.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_MemorialLobby_5_2.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ご心配なさらないでください。たとえ何があっても、私が必ず先生をお守りしますので","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/dg9fdUg1NV4L1mtKRWUbDt0x44MZrwJj.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Relationship_Up_1.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"あまり慣れない感情ですね。 ふわふわとしていて…胸があたたかくなるような、くすぐったい気分です。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/WIXhyy9Z7tLHMZ9WIKMPHQNuciRLKQ0F.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Relationship_Up_2.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"お気付きでしょうか。先生が私を、少しずつ…変えているのだと。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/ORMqz4YoyTh3UdEdJffnXwrwpkDUyzjX.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Relationship_Up_3.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"私が、何かお力になれたら…！","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/hAnwOomQlCxNggomAshUTEc7mgvEy4n4.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Relationship_Up_4.ogg","category":"growup","text":"","text_original":"先生は…いつも返しきれないほどのものを、私に与えるんですから。 …困ったお方です。本当に。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/knfpRANI9E2VWjHQ6XWxOs8yavXYtTHL.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Season_Birthday.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"…覚えていてくださったのですね。ありがとうございます… とても、うれしいです。 では…今日は少しだけ甘えさせていただいても、よろしいでしょうか？ふふ。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/4CWr303idzG0PEoO6DjqOlMk16PQFmgx.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Season_Birthday_Player.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"先生、お誕生日おめでとうございます。 様々な怪我に対応できる救急箱をご用意したのですが、いかがでしょう…？ …お気持ちだけで十分？そう、ですか…。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/WhQZJ3lMYcuyq0LJLP272CeUBncP8y8K.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Season_Halloween.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"ハロウィーンの日になると「素敵な騎士のコスプレですね」と言われるのです。 私にとっては普段着なのですが…毎年、無念でなりません。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/KZv95XYtq5YuzXQIdRporIKmDt9TcA14.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Season_NewYear.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"新年明けましておめでとうございます。 さあ、先生…参りましょうか。 今年も皆さんに救いの手を差し伸べるのです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/kplpuo0nfy7rURLDcH6JO1cYTJAFwzBw.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Season_Xmas.ogg","category":"lobby","text":"","text_original":"クリスマスというのは、「感謝」を「分け合う」ための日と聞きます。 その…先生、クリスマスプレゼントは何がよろしいですか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/FHJhPZWi5nr77vLMEo0tcLgsrdtN4z2i.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Tactic_Defeat_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"まさか、このような……申し訳ありません。私が力不足なばかりに……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/Zqm2ZaBHemwpGCWrks8aiav3IkGdeXUd.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Tactic_Defeat_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"あまりご自身を責めないでください。きっと、大丈夫ですから……。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/yNkEXok4Lc1cZK2x9BGFHP1wmYKPSmcn.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Tactic_In_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"お任せを。私が先頭に立ちます。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/onIFaK6VQ4lmLw5R6xGHNJqPR0mh2niz.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Tactic_In_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"全ての人々に、恵みを。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/VtPlXqLyhCOAZMp1k76iKZCNQLgWgutn.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Tactic_Victory_1.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"皆さん、お怪我はありませんか？","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/0zDVTqS2OQmd0CgrLQbp8sqNwQrq7YVr.ogg"},{"description":"CH0152_Tactic_Victory_2.ogg","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"救護が必要な方を、誰一人逃さない…当然のことです。","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/gp08NzISvLnGMCPFInE5uHHPHh2RyU81.ogg"}],"voice_cn":[{"description":"ch0152_battle_buffed_1","category":"battle","text":"非常感谢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_battle_buffed_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_battle_buffself_1","category":"battle","text":"还没结束呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_battle_buffself_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_battle_damage_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_battle_damage_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_battle_damage_2","category":"battle","text":"竟然……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_battle_damage_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_battle_damage_3","category":"battle","text":"这点小伤……！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_battle_damage_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_battle_defense_1","category":"battle","text":"对我不管用！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_battle_defense_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_battle_in_1","category":"battle","text":"我会冲在前面，掩护就交给你们了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_battle_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_battle_in_2","category":"battle","text":"救护骑士团，出发！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_battle_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_battle_move_1","category":"battle","text":"继续前进。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_battle_move_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_battle_move_2","category":"battle","text":"开始移动。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_battle_move_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_battle_recovery_1","category":"battle","text":"非常感谢，我好多了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_battle_recovery_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_battle_retire","category":"battle","text":"有点……不好受啊……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_battle_retire.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_battle_shout_1","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_battle_shout_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_battle_shout_2","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_battle_shout_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_battle_shout_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_battle_shout_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_battle_tacticalaction_1","category":"battle","text":"接下来去哪？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_battle_tacticalaction_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_battle_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"救护顺利完成。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_battle_victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_battle_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"我们胜利了！但千万不能掉以轻心。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_battle_victory_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_cafe_monolog_1","category":"cafe","text":"这里…… 有没有需要 救护的人呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_cafe_monolog_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_cafe_monolog_2","category":"cafe","text":"这个地方， 真让人放松啊。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_cafe_monolog_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_cafe_monolog_3","category":"cafe","text":"在这里办场 茶会怎么样？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_cafe_monolog_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_cafe_monolog_4","category":"cafe","text":"无论是谁都 需要好好休息。 救护骑士团也不例外。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_cafe_monolog_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_cafe_monolog_5","category":"cafe","text":"饭后一杯茶， 健康又美丽。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_cafe_monolog_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_commonskill","category":"battle","text":"我将全力以赴！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_commonskill.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_exskill_1","category":"battle","text":"我上了！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_exskill_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_exskill_2","category":"battle","text":"原来在那里！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_exskill_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_exskill_3","category":"battle","text":"大家请退后！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_exskill_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_exskill_level_1","category":"battle","text":"向战场伸出救护之手！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_exskill_level_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_exskill_level_2","category":"battle","text":"心怀信念和荣耀！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_exskill_level_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_exskill_level_3","category":"battle","text":"战斗到最后一刻！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_exskill_level_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_exweapon_get","category":"growup","text":"感谢您的关照…… 我愿用我的一切， 成为老师的力量。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_exweapon_get.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_formation_in_1","category":"formation","text":"好的，我们出发吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_formation_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_formation_in_2","category":"formation","text":"轮到救护骑士团出场了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_formation_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_formation_select","category":"formation","text":"啊？！有，有情况吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_formation_select.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_gachaget","category":"growup","text":"我是救护骑士团的团长，苍森美祢。 需要救护的人在哪里？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_gachaget.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_growup_1","category":"growup","text":"您为什么，如此厚待我？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_growup_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_growup_2","category":"growup","text":"老师，谢谢您。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_growup_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_growup_3","category":"growup","text":"呵呵，没想到，我也得到了救护呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_growup_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_growup_4","category":"growup","text":"方便的话，下次一起喝杯茶怎么样？我也想报答您。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_growup_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_lobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"有什么事吗？ 如果需要帮助的话， 请随时叫我。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_lobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_lobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"今天您似乎也很忙呢…… 有什么我帮得上忙的事情吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_lobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_lobby_3","category":"lobby","text":"如果您累了， 请随时告诉我。红茶、点心、膝枕…… 凡是我做得到的，您都可以提。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_lobby_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_lobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"救护骑士团没有用武之地才是好事。希望这样和平的日子能够继续下去。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_lobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_lobby_5","category":"lobby","text":"虽然救护骑士团那边也不错， 但这边也很漂亮呢。要不然， 干脆把分部搬过来……不，没什么， 我只是自言自语，请不要在意。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_lobby_5.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_login_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，欢迎光临。 今天也一起为了基沃托斯的和平努力吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_login_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_login_2","category":"lobby","text":"老师，今天有什么事吗？没关系，我早已习惯等待了， 您不用担心。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_login_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_memoriallobby_1","category":"lobby","text":"老师，您还好吗？ 有没有受伤？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_memoriallobby_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_memoriallobby_2","category":"lobby","text":"夜晚的空气真让人心情舒畅呢。青草的芬芳，潺潺的水声…… 让心灵都平静下来了。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_memoriallobby_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_memoriallobby_3_1","category":"lobby","text":"……您怎么了？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_memoriallobby_3_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_memoriallobby_3_2","category":"lobby","text":"是觉得……太耀眼了吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_memoriallobby_3_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_memoriallobby_4","category":"lobby","text":"呵呵，也许……确实会呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_memoriallobby_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_memoriallobby_5_1","category":"lobby","text":"如果放心不下，您可以靠着我， 或者躺到我的腿上休息一会儿。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_memoriallobby_5_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_memoriallobby_5_2","category":"lobby","text":"请不要担心。 无论发生什么，我都会守护好老师的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_memoriallobby_5_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_relationship_up_1","category":"growup","text":"这种心情有些陌生，又柔和，又温暖……还有些痒痒的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_relationship_up_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_relationship_up_2","category":"growup","text":"您发现了吗？老师……您正在，一点点改变我。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_relationship_up_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_relationship_up_3","category":"growup","text":"有什么，我能帮上忙的吗？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_relationship_up_3.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_relationship_up_4","category":"growup","text":"老师总是给予我这么多，让我难以为报。您真的让我很为难呢，呵呵……","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_relationship_up_4.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_season_birthday","category":"lobby","text":"……原来您还记得呢。谢谢……我真的很开心。那么…… 今天让我稍微撒撒娇也可以吧？呵呵。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_season_birthday.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_season_birthday_player","category":"lobby","text":"老师，祝您生日快乐。啊，我准备了可以处理 各种伤势的急救箱，您觉得怎么样？……有这份心意就够了？ 是吗……？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_season_birthday_player.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_season_chinesenewyear","category":"lobby","text":"老师，祝您新春快乐！ 新的一年里，让我们共同努力， 把救护带到整个基沃托斯！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_season_chinesenewyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_season_halloween","category":"lobby","text":"每到万圣节， 都会有人对我说 “好棒的骑士Cosplay啊”。可对我来说， 这只是日常的穿着…… 每年都让人无奈呢。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_season_halloween.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_season_midautumn","category":"lobby","text":"走吧老师，让我们出发吧！ 什么？您说今天可是中秋节？ 越是这种阖家团圆的节日， 我们就越该保证大家的平安！ 不过，如果老师愿意， 等巡逻结束后，我们可以一起去赏月。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_season_midautumn.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_season_newyear","category":"lobby","text":"祝您新年快乐。好了，老师…… 我们出发吧。今年我也会向大家伸出救护之手。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_season_newyear.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_season_xmas","category":"lobby","text":"听说圣诞节是 “分享”和“感恩”的日子。那个…… 老师，您喜欢什么样的圣诞礼物呢？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_season_xmas.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_tactic_defeat_1","category":"battle","text":"没想到，竟然会输……非常抱歉，都怪我实力不足。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_tactic_defeat_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_tactic_defeat_2","category":"battle","text":"请不要太自责，一定不会有事的。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_tactic_defeat_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_tactic_in_1","category":"battle","text":"我来打头阵，交给我吧。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_tactic_in_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_tactic_in_2","category":"battle","text":"为所有人，献上祝福。","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_tactic_in_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_tactic_victory_1","category":"battle","text":"诸位，都没受伤吧？","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_tactic_victory_1.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_tactic_victory_2","category":"battle","text":"我们不会漏掉任何一个需要救护的人，这是理所应当的！","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_tactic_victory_2.ogg"},{"description":"ch0152_title","category":"lobby","text":"Blue Archive!","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/cn/ch0152_title.ogg"}],"voice_kr":[{"description":"ch0152_battle_damage_3","category":"battle","text":"","text_original":"","file":"//static.kivo.wiki/voices/students/%E8%8B%8D%E6%A3%AE%20%E7%BE%8E%E5%BC%A5/original/ch0152_battle_damage_3.ogg"},{"descripti